data: {"answer": "This is the Lighthouse Security Operations Center (SOC), which monitors logs from every system around the clock. You can see systems for Endpoint Protection (EDR), SIEM & Log Management, and controls like the Incident Response Plan. The room highlights threats such as Ransomware, Password Guessing, and Credential Stuffing, teaching that finding unusual patterns in logs is anomaly detection.", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "What does the Endpoint Protection (EDR) do?", "en": "What does the Endpoint Protection (EDR) do?", "zh": "端點防護（EDR）是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "How do we prevent ransomware?", "en": "How do we prevent ransomware?", "zh": "勒索軟體要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.42, "total_s": 8.44}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "lighthouse", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "lighthouse"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 7.0}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "lighthouse", "label": "Room", "en": "Lighthouse", "zh": "燈塔"}, {"key": "edr", "label": "System", "en": "Endpoint Protection (EDR)", "zh": "端點防護（EDR）"}, {"key": "siem", "label": "System", "en": "SIEM & Log Management", "zh": "SIEM 與日誌管理"}, {"key": "ransomware", "label": "Threat", "en": "Ransomware", "zh": "勒索軟體"}, {"key": "credential_stuffing", "label": "Threat", "en": "Password Guessing & Credential Stuffing", "zh": "密碼猜測與撞庫"}, {"key": "incident_response", "label": "Control", "en": "Incident Response Plan & SOC", "zh": "事件應變計畫與資安監控中心"}, {"key": "logging_monitoring", "label": "Control", "en": "Logging & Monitoring (SIEM)", "zh": "日誌與監控（SIEM）"}, {"key": "edr_antimalware", "label": "Control", "en": "Endpoint Protection (EDR)", "zh": "端點防護（EDR）"}, {"key": "c_anomaly_detection", "label": "Concept", "en": "Anomaly Detection", "zh": "異常偵測"}, {"key": "c_risk", "label": "Concept", "en": "Risk = Likelihood × Impact", "zh": "風險＝可能性×衝擊"}, {"key": "c_soc_siem", "label": "Concept", "en": "SOC & SIEM", "zh": "資安監控中心與 SIEM"}], "edges": [{"a": "siem", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "edr", "t": "SENDS_TO", "b": "siem"}, {"a": "edr", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "ransomware", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "credential_stuffing", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "c_risk", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "c_soc_siem", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "c_soc_siem", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "siem"}, {"a": "c_soc_siem", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "incident_response"}, {"a": "c_soc_siem", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "logging_monitoring"}, {"a": "c_anomaly_detection", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "c_anomaly_detection", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "siem"}, {"a": "c_anomaly_detection", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "logging_monitoring"}, {"a": "c_anomaly_detection", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "c_soc_siem"}, {"a": "edr_antimalware", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "edr_antimalware", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "ransomware"}, {"a": "incident_response", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "incident_response", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "ransomware"}, {"a": "logging_monitoring", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "lighthouse"}, {"a": "logging_monitoring", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "credential_stuffing"}, {"a": "logging_monitoring", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "ransomware"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: Lighthouse · Security Operations Center\nWhat it shows: The SOC watches logs from every system around the clock; the keeper's log is the security log.\nKey lesson: Finding unusual patterns in logs is data mining at work: anomaly detection.\nSystems here: Endpoint Protection (EDR), SIEM & Log Management\nThreats shown here: Ransomware, Password Guessing & Credential Stuffing\nControls you can see: Incident Response Plan & SOC, Logging & Monitoring (SIEM), Endpoint Protection (EDR)\nConcepts: Anomaly Detection, Risk = Likelihood × Impact, SOC & SIEM\nProcedures to know: Ransomware or encrypted files\nHidden security weaknesses in this room: 1 (the player has to spot them; do not reveal them)\nExits: On the Lake · Offsite Backup", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.42, "load_s": 0.0, "prompt_tokens": 606, "prompt_s": 2.54, "gen_tokens": 76, "gen_s": 5.86, "tok_per_s": 13.0, "first_token_s": 2.56}}, "state": {}}

